# Deliberately empty of rules.
#
# npm falls back to `.gitignore` when a directory has no `.npmignore`, and
# `web/.gitignore` ignores `dist/` — which is the built dashboard, exactly the
# thing the published package needs. This file exists to override that fallback
# for this directory; `files` in `package.json` is what actually selects
# `web/dist`.
#
# Verify with `npm pack --dry-run`: `web/dist/index.html` must be listed, and
# `web/src/**` must not.
